ates as a subsidiary of Mitalim Holding Sdn Bhd.","zh":"Golden Destinations Group Berhad 是一家出境旅游体验策划公司，以 Golden Destinations (GD) 品牌运营，2019 年注册成立，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡，隶属于 Mitalim Holding Sdn Bhd。公司以 B2B 模式运营，服务于持牌旅行社网络。","lines":["系列旅游体验套餐：策划并提供包含行程规划、交通、餐饮和住宿的系列旅游产品，客户为持牌旅行社。","邮轮旅游体验套餐：提供邮轮旅游体验产品，客户为持牌旅行社。","票务与导游服务：提供票务及导游服务，客户为持牌旅行社。","酒店预订服务 (G-Stay)：提供酒店预订服务，客户为持牌旅行社。","签证申请服务 (ICE Visa)：提供签证申请服务，客户为持牌旅行社。"],"lines_en":["Series travel experience packages: plans and provides series travel products including itinerary planning, transportation, meals and accommodation, serving licensed travel agents.","Cruise travel experience packages: offers cruise travel experience products to licensed travel agents.","Ticketing and tour guide services: provides ticketing and tour guide services to licensed travel agents.","Hotel reservation services (G-Stay): provides hotel booking services to licensed travel agents.","Visa application services (ICE Visa): provides visa application services to licensed travel agents."]}}